22:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","p","Kucing APK, often called Kucing ",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Kucing APK, often called Kucing Pink, is a third-party anime streaming app circulating outside Google Play Store, claiming free anime with Indonesian subtitles. It is searched over a hundred thousand times a month in Indonesia - so we wrote an honest explainer."}],["$","p","Our position is clear: this page",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Our position is clear: this page is INFORMATION ONLY. Kucing APK is unofficial and unverified, and it shows licensed works with no clear licensing path. We provide no file, no download link, and no installation instructions. What we provide is the facts, the risks, and legal alternatives that are genuinely safe."}]]}]
23:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":["What ","Kucing APK"," Does"]}],[["$","p","Official apps must pass Google's",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Official apps must pass Google's review and, for a streaming service, prove their right to show the content. Kucing APK circulates only as files on third-party websites, under changing names and packaging, with no verifiable developer. The size and feature claims on those sites come from the sites themselves; no official source confirms them. Nobody is accountable if the app changes behaviour or stops working - that absence is itself the risk."}],["$","p","The practical risks stack up qui",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"The practical risks stack up quickly. Device security: files from outside Play Store are not vetted the same way, and pirated streaming apps are among the categories most often repackaged with aggressive ads, data collectors, and harmful payloads - you can never be sure the file is genuine. Law: anime is licensed work, shown here without permission. Privacy: there is no auditable privacy policy. Quality: servers are slow, links die, subtitles inconsistent."}]]]}]
24:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Safety & Privacy"}],[["$","p","Our honest answer: Kucing APK ca",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Our honest answer: Kucing APK cannot be called safe, and no trustworthy party can call it safe. An unverified developer, distribution outside the official store, pirated content, and files anyone can repackage - together, that is the definition of a high-risk app in our safety guide."}],["$","p","If you or your family already in",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"If you or your family already installed it: delete the app, turn the unknown-sources install permission back off, run a Google Play Protect scan, and change important passwords if anything odd happens. Then move to the legal alternatives - most popular titles are officially free."}]]]}]
